  "description": "The Shadows of the Heavenly Demon Cult undergo extreme training beyond human limits solely to protect the young cult leader. Throughout their terrifying history, not a single Shadow has ever managed to rise to the rank of Cult Elder. However, a historic anomaly occurs when a Shadow reaches the pinnacle of demonic martial arts mastery for the very first time.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69794848), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A0%84%EC%83%9D%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%B8/4915)",
